sequenceDiagram
    %% TrustChain-AI: Sequence Diagram — End-to-End Tier Interaction (UI -> API -> DB)

    autonumber
    actor User as Operator / User
    participant UI as React 19 UI Component (e.g., TelemetryCenter)
    participant Client as Axios API Client (api.js)
    participant Gateway as FastAPI Router (/registry/telemetry)
    participant AuthDep as Security Dependency (get_current_active_user)
    participant TrustSvc as TrustEngine & Service Layer
    participant ORM as SQLAlchemy 2.0 ORM Session
    participant SQLite as SQLite Database (vdr.db WAL Mode)

    User->>UI: Input Telemetry Data & Click "Submit Observation"
    UI->>Client: api.submitTelemetry(payload)
    Client->>Client: Retrieve JWT Access Token from Storage
    Client->>Gateway: HTTP POST /registry/telemetry<br/>Headers: {Authorization: "Bearer eyJhbGciOi..."}<br/>Body: {agent_did, task_id, success: true, compliance: true, latency_ms: 120}

    %% Gateway & Auth Dependency
    Gateway->>AuthDep: Validate Request Context
    AuthDep->>AuthDep: Decode & Verify JWT Signature (HS256)
    AuthDep->>ORM: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = user_id
    ORM->>SQLite: PRAGMA query + SELECT users
    SQLite-->>ORM: User Row: role="OPERATOR", is_active=True
    ORM-->>AuthDep: UserModel Object
    AuthDep-->>Gateway: Authenticated User Principal (Role Authorized)

    %% Service Execution
    Gateway->>TrustSvc: process_telemetry_event(payload, db_session)
    TrustSvc->>ORM: Add TelemetryLogModel
    ORM->>SQLite: INSERT INTO telemetry_logs (...)
    SQLite-->>ORM: Row Inserted

    %% Trust Re-evaluation Window
    TrustSvc->>ORM: Query last 10 telemetry records for agent_did
    ORM->>SQLite: SELECT * FROM telemetry_logs WHERE agent_did = ? ORDER BY timestamp DESC LIMIT 10
    SQLite-->>ORM: 10 Records Returned
    ORM-->>TrustSvc: List of TelemetryLogModel Objects

    Note over TrustSvc: In-Memory Trust Mathematics:<br/>1. S_i = 10/10 = 1.0, C_i = 10/10 = 1.0, L_i = 120/2000 = 0.06<br/>2. P_i = 0.6(1.0) + 0.3(1.0) + 0.1(1 - 0.06) = 0.994<br/>3. T_i = 0.7(0.994) + 0.3(0.950) = 0.9808 (TRUSTED)

    TrustSvc->>ORM: UPDATE agent_trust_states SET temporal_trust_score = 0.9808
    ORM->>SQLite: COMMIT Transaction (Write to WAL buffer)
    SQLite-->>ORM: Transaction Committed
    TrustSvc-->>Gateway: TrustEvaluationResponse(score=0.9808, state="TRUSTED")

    %% Response Serialization
    Gateway->>Gateway: Serialize via Pydantic v2 Schema
    Gateway-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK<br/>Body: {status: "ok", trust_score: 0.9808, trust_state: "TRUSTED"}
    
    %% UI State Update
    Client-->>UI: Promise Resolved with Data
    UI->>UI: Update React State (useState / useEffect)<br/>Re-render Recharts Trend Line & Status Badges
    UI-->>User: Display Toast: "Telemetry Recorded — Agent Trust: 0.98 (TRUSTED)"
